What was changed
----------------
The code was rewritten for the Cleanroom loader under a new mod id and package. Behaviour follows Special AI 1.1.0
except where listed in src/main/resources/changelog.txt. The villager name syllables and job titles, the config
option names and their descriptions, and the design of every AI pattern are Father Toast's work.

The build template is CleanroomMC's CleanroomModTemplate. Its build scripts and style configuration files remain
under their own terms.
